SUMMARY:Mass Effect Legendary Edition | The Community Isn't Going Anywhere
 #SaveMassEffect
DESCRIPTION:Saturday is something special as we return to the Mass Effect
 Legendary Edition for a community-focused stream.\n\nThe Mass Effect
 universe has given us unforgettable characters, incredible stories,
 difficult choices, and a galaxy that means so much to its fans. Tonight is
 about celebrating that connection, sharing our love for the series, and
 showing that the community is still here.\n\n#SaveMassEffect - because the
 community isn't going anywhere.\n\nWhether you're a longtime Commander
 Shepard fan, a Normandy veteran, or someone discovering the series for the
 first time, come along, join the conversation, and celebrate the galaxy
 with us. The Mass Effect Legendary Edition includes single-player base
 content and over 40 DLC from the highly acclaimed Mass Effect, Mass Effect
 2, and Mass Effect 3 games, including promo weapons, armours, and packs,
 remastered and optimized for 4K Ultra HD.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sbrXpvk7R6o
CATEGORIES:Mass Effect Legendary Edition
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
