SUMMARY:Movie Night | Ep. 89 - Star Trek: The Motion Picture Director's
 Edition (1979)
DESCRIPTION:After surviving construction projects, Starfleet emergencies,
 wartime stealth missions, magical forests, outlaw trouble, and another
 week of getting distracted in Cyrodiil, it's time to relax with the
 community for Movie Night Episode 89. Grab your favourite snacks, get
 comfortable, and join us for a chilled-out end to another busy week. Meet
 you all on Discord for Movie Night.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Movie Night
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
