LAST-MODIFIED:20261114T211000Z
DTSTART:20261109T213000Z
DTEND:20261109T233000Z
SUMMARY:Motor Town: Behind The Wheel | Ep. 18 - The Architect Assures Me
 the Bus Will Fit He's Gone Home Now
DESCRIPTION:We're back behind the wheel in Motor Town, and this time
 somebody has apparently designed something with the absolute confidence
 that a bus will fit through it. The architect says it'll be fine. The
 architect has also conveniently gone home. I suspect we're about to
 discover why those two facts are connected. Enjoy realistic driving in the
 open world. Relaxing cargo deliveries or driving buses and taxis will give
 you enough money to buy new cars and parts. You can test your driving
 skills at the race track. It's all about pure driving pleasure!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VDUSG1A5UDI
CATEGORIES:Motor Town: Behind The Wheel
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-25112211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20261022T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261114T211000Z
DTSTART:20261112T213000Z
DTEND:20261112T233000Z
SUMMARY:Velvet Assassin | Ep. 2 - It's a House of God, Lads. Keep the
 Screaming Down.
DESCRIPTION:Our stealthy wartime adventure continues as we return to
 Velvet Assassin. Tonight we're attempting careful infiltration, quiet
 movement, and the sort of discretion that becomes increasingly difficult
 when guards start noticing their colleagues have disappeared. Let's try to
 keep things respectful. And preferably silent. Step into the shadows of
 World War II as British secret agent Violette Summer in this dark and
 atmospheric stealth adventure inspired by the story of real-life agent
 Violette Szabo. Deep behind enemy lines, we'll infiltrate heavily guarded
 locations, sabotage enemy operations and use darkness to remain unseen
 while silently dealing with anyone standing in our way. With missions
 unfolding through Violette's feverish memories from a hospital bed,
 surreal environments and a strong focus on stealth, patience and timing,
 we'll see if we have what it takes to survive some extremely dangerous
 assignments.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VNRlbWQXqQY
CATEGORIES:Velvet Assassin
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
