SUMMARY:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered | Ep. 5 - The Nine
 Divines Have Reviewed My Case and Declined to Comment
DESCRIPTION:We're heading back into Cyrodiil for another adventure in
 Oblivion Remastered. There are quests to complete, dangerous creatures to
 fight, ancient ruins to explore, and a growing list of questionable
 decisions that apparently even the Nine Divines would rather not discuss.
 Divine intervention would be appreciated, but it seems we've been left to
 sort this one out ourselves. Return to the province of Cyrodiil in a
 remastered version of the legendary open-world RPG. With the Emperor slain
 and mysterious Oblivion Gates opening across the land, we'll create our
 character, explore towns and ancient ruins, take on quests, join factions,
 delve into dangerous dungeons and battle the forces of Mehrunes Dagon.
 Whether we follow the main story or get completely distracted by side
 quests, there's a huge fantasy world waiting to be rediscovered.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
