SUMMARY:Movie Night | Ep. 90 - Paul (2011)
DESCRIPTION:We've reached Movie Night Episode 90, and we're celebrating
 with the sci-fi comedy Paul (2011)! Join us for a hilarious
 extraterrestrial road trip as two science-fiction enthusiasts encounter an
 alien who turns out to be considerably less mysterious and dignified than
 they might have expected. Grab your favourite snacks, settle in with the
 community, and join us for a relaxed evening of laughs, sci-fi references,
 and alien-related nonsense. It's the perfect way to celebrate our 90th
 Movie Night! Meet you all on Discord for Movie Night.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Movie Night
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-25152211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20261026T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261114T211000Z
DTSTART:20261116T213000Z
DTEND:20261116T233000Z
SUMMARY:Truck World: Australia | Ep. 1 - Keep the Shiny Side Up! Whichever
 Way That Is in Australia.
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new trucking adventure begins as we hit the Australian
 roads! Expect heavy cargo, unfamiliar routes, and the occasional
 disagreement with gravity. Apparently, keeping the shiny side up is harder
 when you're Down Under. Get ready to hit the open road as we take on the
 life of a truck driver in Truck World: Australia! We'll climb behind the
 wheel of powerful trucks, haul cargo across vast Australian landscapes and
 experience the challenges of transporting goods through bustling towns,
 winding highways and the rugged Outback. From managing our deliveries and
 navigating long stretches of road to tackling changing weather and keeping
 our truck in good condition, there's plenty to keep us busy. With
 beautiful scenery, challenging routes and the freedom of the open road,
 we'll see if we have what it takes to become a successful Australian
 trucker. Expect relaxing drives, questionable navigation, plenty of
 sightseeing and hopefully getting our deliveries to their destinations in
 one piece!
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Truck World: Australia
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
