UID:stream-25172211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20261028T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261114T211000Z
DTSTART:20261118T213000Z
DTEND:20261118T233000Z
SUMMARY:Sort Them Cats | Ep. 1 - Who Put the Astronaut Cat in With the
 Pirates?
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new puzzle adventure begins, and apparently somebody
 has mixed up all the cats! Astronauts, pirates, and who knows what else.
 Time to restore some order before the cats decide they're running the
 place. Get ready for some adorable feline chaos as we dive into the
 wonderfully cosy world of Sort Them Cats! We've got a shop overflowing
 with thousands of cute cat figurines, and it's our job to bring some order
 to the madness. We'll search through colourful piles, match cats to their
 correct shelves, earn paw coins and unlock helpful upgrades to make our
 sorting adventures a little easier. With over 5,000 collectible cats
 across 25 different themes, including pirates, space explorers and musical
 felines, there's certainly no shortage of furry friends to discover. Along
 the way, we'll hunt for hidden surprises, build a colourful cat tower and
 hopefully transform our chaotic shop into a perfectly organised paradise.
 Expect plenty of cute cats, relaxing gameplay, questionable organisational
 skills and the inevitable temptation to sort just one more shelf!
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Sort Them Cats
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-25182211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20261029T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261114T211000Z
DTSTART:20261119T213000Z
DTEND:20261119T233000Z
SUMMARY:Counter-Strike 2 | Ep. 3 - Shooty Shooty Bang Bang, Who's Got the
 Flashbang?
DESCRIPTION:We're back in Counter-Strike 2 for another evening of tactical
 shooting, teamwork, and questionable decisions. The plan is simple:
 communicate, work together, and preferably avoid flashbanging our own
 team. What could possibly go wrong? For over two decades, Counter-Strike
 has offered an elite competitive experience, one shaped by millions of
 players from across the globe. And now the next chapter in the CS story is
 about to begin. This is Counter-Strike 2.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Counter-Strike 2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
