SUMMARY:Comic-Con | Flight - Comic-Con Ireland
DESCRIPTION:It's travel day! We're swapping gaming chairs for aeroplane
 seats as we head to Comic-Con Ireland. No live stream tonight, but I'll
 share photos and videos on Discord, Instagram and TikTok whenever
 possible. Hopefully I'll remember my passport. A special IRL trip to
 Comic-Con Ireland for a weekend celebrating movies, television, comics and
 pop culture. I'll be heading along to enjoy the convention and meet some
 incredible guests, including William Shatner, Elijah Wood, Sean Astin,
 Miranda Otto and Steve Guttenberg. There won't be a live stream from the
 event, but expect plenty of stories and memories from the trip!
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Comic-Con
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
