DESCRIPTION:We're back for another day of convention adventures! More
 costumes, more exploring, and probably more things we don't have room for
 in the suitcase. No regular Movie Night this Sunday, but I'll share
 updates whenever I can. A special IRL trip to Comic-Con Ireland for a
